    "detailed_description": "&quot;Toad's Soul Hopper&quot; is a hopping action game where the dependable scientist Toad from &quot;Goonya Monster&quot; makes his mark.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHis fellow Busters have been enlarged by the mad scientist, Anemone's prank. To save them, Toad jumps into action with his custom-made hopping machine, the &quot;Soul Hopper&quot;!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n...Jumping to save friends?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Easy Controls?<br />\r\nToad on his hopper is constantly bouncing. Press the button as he lands to charge power, then release it to make a big jump, adjusting the angle while charging.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Bouncing, rebounding, falling...<br />\r\nIf Toad's body or the side of the hopper hits a wall or the ground, he'll rebound. One moment of carelessness can lead to a fall and a familiar view below.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 A treacherous path<br />\r\nPlatforms may collapse or catch fire, hindering your ascent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Can you see the summit?<br />\r\nCompete for the fastest time to the top with the local rankings, which store the top 10 scores. Aim higher than your past self!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Toad's Soul Hopper&quot; is a hopping action game where the dependable scientist Toad from &quot;Goonya Monster&quot; makes his mark.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHis fellow Busters have been enlarged by the mad scientist, Anemone's prank. To save them, Toad jumps into action with his custom-made hopping machine, the &quot;Soul Hopper&quot;!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n...Jumping to save friends?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Easy Controls?<br />\r\nToad on his hopper is constantly bouncing. Press the button as he lands to charge power, then release it to make a big jump, adjusting the angle while charging.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Bouncing, rebounding, falling...<br />\r\nIf Toad's body or the side of the hopper hits a wall or the ground, he'll rebound. One moment of carelessness can lead to a fall and a familiar view below.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 A treacherous path<br />\r\nPlatforms may collapse or catch fire, hindering your ascent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Can you see the summit?<br />\r\nCompete for the fastest time to the top with the local rankings, which store the top 10 scores. Aim higher than your past self!",
    "short_description": "From the asymmetrical party action game 'Goonya Monster' designed by Terada Tera , a spin-off work has emerged! &quot;Toad's Soul Hopper&quot; is hopping action game where you aim for the top from bottom to top! Will he soar into action with weapons in hand to stop Anemone's mischief and save his friends?",
